### 12 cli refresh
$ xmd refresh --root <root>
exit 1
--- stderr
xmd: https://ci.example/builds/2: Module builds.decode: build /builds/2 is broken
https://ci.example/builds/3: Module builds.decode: Unknown field 'ok'
https://ci.example/builds/4: expected ident at line 1 column 2
https://ci.example/builds/5: <root>/.xmd/modules/./bin/build-status failed: unknown build /builds/5
quote FAIL: no such symbol
quote FILE: quotes: a provider can only make http requests
quote LOOPS: quotes did not finish
quote NOURL: An http request needs a url
quote RECORD: quotes: step must return a record
quote SPIN: quotes did not finish

